"Gå till <menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Visa "
"rullningslister</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/view/show-sample-points.xml:11(title)
msgid "Show Sample Points"
msgstr "Visa samplingspunkter"

#: src/menus/view/show-sample-points.xml:14(primary)
msgid "Sample Points"
msgstr "Samplingspunkter"

#: src/menus/view/show-sample-points.xml:16(para)
msgid ""
"This command enables and disables showing the sample points in the image "
"window. Sample points are used to display color information in the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-sample-point-dialog\">sample points dialog</link>."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot aktiverar och inaktiverar visningen av samplingspunkter i "
"bildfönstret. Samplingspunkterna används för att visa färginformation i "
"<link linkend=\"gimp-sample-point-dialog\">dialogrutan "
"Samplingspunkter</link>."

#: src/menus/view/show-sample-points.xml:21(para)
msgid ""
"You can set the default for showing sample points in the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-window-appearance\">Image Window Appearance "
"Preferences</link>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange standardinställningen för visning av samplingspunkter i <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-prefs-image-window-appearance\">inställningarna för "
"bildfönstrets utseende</link>."

#: src/menus/view/show-sample-points.xml:28(para)
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show Sample "
"Points</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Gå till <menuchoice><guimenu>Visa</guimenu><guimenuitem>Visa "
"samplingspunkter</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

